message: "If you use or build on this work, please cite it as below."
title: "The Business Case for Accurate Baseline Health Facility Data"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-based estimate of the cost of inaccurate health facility data,
  built by comparing an official facility list with the healthsites.io /
  OpenStreetMap dataset and applying published survey and verification costs.
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
